WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.744
Watch and read: Ama asks: Where in a home is the place where food is prepared?

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.710
The answer is: kitchen. Name places found at home.

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:13.755
Watch and read: Ama asks: What shows good manners when you receive help?

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:18.499
The answer is: Say thank you. Polite words and actions show respect.
